# Placed by /ywr-harness:harness-init. Nested on purpose: the consuming repo's root .gitignore is
# its own file and the scaffold never edits it, but the bytecode these scripts generate on import
# must not reach the diff — the CI gate treats a file no declared group claims as ungated and
# fails, so an untracked .pyc would fail every run. Measured on the first end-to-end scaffold.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
